@format 1
@id export.load-presets
@title Import preset
@area Export
@entry input
@summary Read one selected preset JSON file, assign it a collision-free name, persist it, and select it.
@flow TB
@related export.save-presets

@alias export = Cadroue.UIShell.PPanels.PExport

[input] Import presets requested <input>
- Show an open-file dialog for preset JSON @ export.PExportPresetLoad(...)
> read

[read] Read preset file <decision>
- Parse and validate the selected preset file @ export.PExportPresetLoad(...)
? "File is invalid or unreadable" > failed
? "A valid preset is read" > merge

[merge] Store imported preset <process>
- Resolve a unique name, copy the imported state, persist it, select it, and refresh the summary @ export.PExportPresetLoad(...)
> result

[result] Preset imported <output>
= The imported preset is selected under its resolved unique name.

[failed] Import failed <error>
= Existing presets remain authoritative.
